    "statement": "At pair union rho+3, the rank-two normal form is valid in both orientations for every endpoint-deficit pattern. The two gcds exchange endpoints and share all other roots; every forward or reverse residual root is deficit zero, and all residual root sets are pairwise disjoint. If R=r_alpha+r_beta, their common degree g and exact unused slack s satisfy s=(R+5)g-(R+3)e+2>=0. All packet deficit e-6 lies on the common center line or this slack, giving the arm-specific inequalities in (BHL8) and the official floors in (BHL9).",
